  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:290px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">People's Republic of Bangladesh\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:115%; font-weight:bold;\">গণপ্রজাতন্ত্রী বাংলাদেশ\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>1971–2141</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:95%;\"><b>Anthem</b><br />আমার সোনার বাংলা<br />\"My Golden Bengal\"\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">Dhaka\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Languages</b>\n</td>\n<td>Bengali, Assamese, Mizo, Manipuri, English\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Religion</b>\n</td>\n<td>Islam, Buddhism, Christianity, Hinduism\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Federal Parliamentary republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>Parliament of Bangladesh\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">1971\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Disestablished\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2141\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Currency</b>\n</td>\n<td>Taka\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p><b>Bangladesh</b>, officially the <b>People's Republic of Bangladesh</b>, was a nation in South Asia between 1971 and 2141, until it was incorporated into the United Indian Republic as part of U.S. President Lionel Halvidar's effort to establish associated states around the world. It was one of the most populous countries in the world, and among the most densely populated. In its post-Flood configuration it was bordered by India to the west, Tibet to the north, and Myanmar to the east.</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081305\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 796/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7247/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1502/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 15/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639899/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.770      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   43.770      1 -total\n 62.36%   27.293      2 Template:Ns0\n 56.08%   24.544      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 28.03%   12.267      2 Template:Str_find\n  4.12%    1.802      2 Template:Ordinal\n  3.16%    1.38